@namespace Aetheus.Front.Components.Shared
@* Loading level 3 (docs/architecture/omnieurope-ui-customizations.md, "Niveaux de chargement"): everything is loaded
   except this component, so only this component is veiled. OE's OmniPageVeil with Scope Parent covers the host below
   (the component's own area), the site's plane at its centre, in the same drawing and size as the splash and the
   content-area veil. The host keeps a minimum height so the plane stays whole while the content is not there yet.
   Declare it where the content will appear: <ZoneVeil Busy="@_loading" />, or <ZoneVeil /> in the branch that waits. *@
<div class="zone-veil-host">
    <OmniPageVeil Scope="OmniPageVeilScope.Parent" Busy="Busy" Label="@(Label ?? L["Loading"])">
        <Logo><AetheusMark /></Logo>
    </OmniPageVeil>
</div>
